  "referenceNumber": "MYA0064",
  "remarks": "\nZaw Min Tun is an involved person under The Myanmar (Sanctions) Regulations 2021 because he is a member of Asia Sun Trading Company Limited, which is and has been involved in the repression of the civilian population of Myanmar by making available economic resources (aviation fuel) directly or indirectly to or for the benefit of the Myanmar security forces.  \n",
